      "text": "TEXTURE:                                STRUCTURE:\n  Permanent; parent material-derived      Temporary; biologically built\n  Sand + silt + clay percentages          Arrangement of particles into aggregates\n  Cannot be changed without soil removal  Can be improved or destroyed\n  Determines upper limit of fertility     Determines actual water/air movement\n  \"The hand you're dealt\"                 \"How you play the hand\""
    },
