        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Soil Texture and Structure: Sand/Silt/Clay Triangle, Aggregates",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n  STOKES' LAW:\n  v = (2r²(ρp - ρf)g) / (9η)"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-TEXTURE-STRUCTURE.md#027",
      "path": [
        "03-TEXTURE-STRUCTURE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:soil-science:03-texture-structure, git-history:soil-science:03-texture-structure]",
        "canonical_path": "soil-science/03-TEXTURE-STRUCTURE.md",
        "concepts": "[texture, structure]",
        "current_path": "soil-science/03-TEXTURE-STRUCTURE.md",
        "id": "maxim:soil-science:texture-structure",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
