        "module": "soil-science",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[texture, structure]",
        "section": "soil-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Soil Texture and Structure: Sand/Silt/Clay Triangle, Aggregates",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Where:\n    v  = settling velocity (m/s)\n    r  = particle radius (m)\n    ρp = particle density (~2.65 g/cm³ for soil minerals)\n    ρf = fluid density (~1.0 g/cm³ for water)\n    g  = gravitational acceleration (9.8 m/s²)\n    η  = fluid viscosity (temperature-dependent)"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-TEXTURE-STRUCTURE.md#028",
      "path": [
        "03-TEXTURE-STRUCTURE.md"
