        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Soil Texture and Structure: Sand/Silt/Clay Triangle, Aggregates",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SETTLING TIMES AT 20°C:\n  Sand (0.1 mm radius = 0.05 mm, fine sand):  ~ 30 seconds to settle 10 cm\n  Silt (0.001 mm radius = 2 µm upper):          ~ 4 hours to settle 10 cm\n  Clay (< 0.001 mm, < 2 µm):                  > 8 hours at 10 cm depth"
    },
