        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "HYDROMETER TEST:\n  Disperse soil (destroy aggregates with sodium hexametaphosphate)\n  Put in 1 L cylinder; stir; measure hydrometer reading at:\n  40 sec (sand removed; reading = silt + clay remaining in suspension)\n  2 hr (silt also settled; reading = clay remaining)\n  Calculate: %sand, %silt, %clay from readings\n  Plot on triangle to determine textural class\n```"
